+
+## Immutable pre-gate boundary
+
+- Authored charge action: `16069`, `arraysubs_process_renewal`, scheduled `2026-08-09 13:15:03Z` / `19:15:03` site.
+- The supplied evening facts snapshot was generated at `19:10:02` site, one second before the authored final-five-minute interval. It was not used as the task baseline.
+- Fresh baseline captured at `2026-08-09 13:11:55Z` / `19:11:55` site.
+- Mailpit cursor: `1nNebR5w8kMlGkz5ROap0o`.
+- Action `16069` was pending and unattempted.
+- Subscription `12684` was `arraysubs-active`, `_completed_payments=4`, `_next_payment_date=2026-08-09 10:58:59Z`.
+- Relationship order `13459` was `wc-pending` for `$30.00`.
+
+## Natural execution and exact relationship result
+
+- Polls at intervals of 30 seconds showed no early execution through `19:14:39` site.
+- Action `16069` completed naturally via WP Cron: scheduled/start `2026-08-09 13:15:03Z`; completion/last attempt `13:15:09Z`.
+- Action logs say `action started via WP Cron` and `action complete via WP Cron`.
+- Exactly one distinct relationship order exists for subscription `12684` and scheduled cycle `2026-08-09 10:58:59Z`: order `13459`.
+- Order `13459` is `wc-completed`, total `$30.00`, transaction `ch_3U2WZBJG5OzSNVs21urZlLSa`.
+- Renewal meta: `_is_renewal_order=yes`, `_renewal_cycle_number=5`, `_renewal_scheduled_date=2026-08-09 10:58:59`, `_subscription_id=12684`, `_subscription_renewal=12684`.
+- It has one product line, `SLT Daily Core`, quantity `3`, line total `$30.00`.
+- Subscription remains active; `_completed_payments=5`; `_next_payment_date=2026-08-10 10:58:59Z`.
+- Replacement invoice/charge actions are `16457` at `2026-08-10 07:15:03Z` and `16458` at `2026-08-10 13:15:03Z`, both pending.
+
+## Mailpit delta and stable cutoff
+
+Exactly two messages appeared after the immutable cursor:
+
+1. `4nH1dBVGAvCbVKpRPmktpo` — `[mirror-help.arrayhash.com]: You've got a new order: #13459` — to `admin@mirror-help.arrayhash.com`.
+2. `1x4morUxkAMA6TRa9Q4ots` — `[mirror-help.arrayhash.com] Payment received for subscription #12684` — to `slt-chk-qty@example.test`; body states `$30.00`, Stripe, and next payment 10 August 2026 4:58 PM (UTC+6).
+
+At the `19:25:24` site cutoff the same two messages were still the complete delta; no duplicate, invoice, failure, retry, or on-hold mail appeared.
+
+## Browser proof
+
