+# D07 evening natural renewal — subscription 12684
+
+Observation date: 2026-08-09 (D07), site timezone UTC+6.
+Context: watch-level natural Stripe renewal for the SLT-CHK-09 quantity-three fixture. No Action Scheduler row was forced and no state was mutated by the watcher.
