+- `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-SW-05-D07-order-13462.png` visibly proves Completed, Payment via Paddle with transaction `txn_01kzkeybgsey4fh7r53v2efhag`, linked subscription `13344`, one Basic line at quantity `1`, and `$5.00` paid. Browser errors were empty and no actionable console error appeared.
+- The exact browser session `admin-SLT-SW-05-D07-watch` was closed. The CLI retained a stale session-list marker, but no matching browser process remained; unrelated `default` was preserved.
+- New finding filed: `issues/SLT-SW-05-paddle-renewal-leaves-subscription-last-transaction-stale.md`. At stable comparison, both Paddle subscriptions `13344` and `12639` retained their initial checkout transaction in subscription `_last_gateway_transaction_id`, while same-watch Stripe controls `12684` and `12221` stored their newest renewal transaction.
+- Existing findings updated rather than duplicated:
