+# SLT-SW-05 D07 natural Basic renewal — subscription 13344
+
+Observation date: 2026-08-09 (D07), site timezone UTC+6.
+Context: watch-level natural Paddle sandbox renewal of the unswitched Basic fixture. The D06 proration checkout failed, so card 96 correctly remains closed and this event is not scored as the authored `$15 local / $5 remote` switch comparison. No action was forced and no site state was mutated by this watcher.
+
+## Immutable pre-gate boundary
+
+- Exact remote gate: `2026-08-09T14:30:08.245157Z` / `20:30:08.245157` site.
+- Immutable local boundary: `2026-08-09 14:14:04Z` / `20:14:04` site, more than five minutes before the gate.
+- `MAIL_PRE=1x4morUxkAMA6TRa9Q4ots`.
+- Local action `16097` was pending and unattempted; relationship order `13462` was `wc-pending` with no transaction; Paddle webhook high-water row was `548`.
+- Sanitized remote transaction set was independently unchanged at `14:00:40Z`: only initial transaction `txn_01kzgv8fc6kg5hcwkm42ds4a4c`, completed / API origin / `500 USD`.
+- A final remote revalidation at `14:29:47Z` again showed active subscription `sub_01kzgwg0b05gx4ryprhxa32fns`, one Basic item at `500 USD`, the same sole transaction, and unchanged `next_billed_at`. It is a last-second confirmation, not the immutable five-minute boundary.
+- The attempted final local batch named an unavailable HPOS timestamp column and returned an SQL error before any SQL result. It was read-only and made no change; the successful `14:14:04Z` boundary remains authoritative.
+
+## Natural Paddle transaction and webhook proof
+
+- Exact transaction: `txn_01kzkeybgsey4fh7r53v2efhag`.
+- Status/origin: `completed` / `subscription_recurring`.
+- Created `2026-08-09T14:31:02.505316Z`; billed `14:31:02.425186Z`; captured `14:31:04.732244Z`; updated `14:31:06.705947Z`.
+- Total: `500 USD` minor units (`$5.00`), captured on Visa ending `4242`. No full card number or credential is retained.
+- Remote subscription remains active on price `pri_01kzgv8etdnw9y2b7jba5fgz93`, one item at `500 USD`; `next_billed_at` advanced exactly one day to `2026-08-10T14:30:08.245157Z`.
