+# SLT-SW-05 D07 natural Basic renewal — subscription 13344
+
+Observation date: 2026-08-09 (D07), site timezone UTC+6.
+Context: watch-level natural Paddle sandbox renewal of the unswitched Basic fixture. The D06 proration checkout failed, so card 96 correctly remains closed and this event is not scored as the authored `$15 local / $5 remote` switch comparison. No action was forced and no site state was mutated by this watcher.
+
+## Immutable pre-gate boundary
+
+- Exact remote gate: `2026-08-09T14:30:08.245157Z` / `20:30:08.245157` site.
+- Immutable local boundary: `2026-08-09 14:14:04Z` / `20:14:04` site, more than five minutes before the gate.
+- `MAIL_PRE=1x4morUxkAMA6TRa9Q4ots`.
+- Local action `16097` was pending and unattempted; relationship order `13462` was `wc-pending` with no transaction; Paddle webhook high-water row was `548`.
+- Sanitized remote transaction set was independently unchanged at `14:00:40Z`: only initial transaction `txn_01kzgv8fc6kg5hcwkm42ds4a4c`, completed / API origin / `500 USD`.
+- A final remote revalidation at `14:29:47Z` again showed active subscription `sub_01kzgwg0b05gx4ryprhxa32fns`, one Basic item at `500 USD`, the same sole transaction, and unchanged `next_billed_at`. It is a last-second confirmation, not the immutable five-minute boundary.
+- The attempted final local batch named an unavailable HPOS timestamp column and returned an SQL error before any SQL result. It was read-only and made no change; the successful `14:14:04Z` boundary remains authoritative.
+
+## Natural Paddle transaction and webhook proof
+
+- Exact transaction: `txn_01kzkeybgsey4fh7r53v2efhag`.
+- Status/origin: `completed` / `subscription_recurring`.
+- Created `2026-08-09T14:31:02.505316Z`; billed `14:31:02.425186Z`; captured `14:31:04.732244Z`; updated `14:31:06.705947Z`.
+- Total: `500 USD` minor units (`$5.00`), captured on Visa ending `4242`. No full card number or credential is retained.
+- Remote subscription remains active on price `pri_01kzgv8etdnw9y2b7jba5fgz93`, one item at `500 USD`; `next_billed_at` advanced exactly one day to `2026-08-10T14:30:08.245157Z`.
+- Local webhook ledger added exactly `subscription.updated` event `evt_01kzkeyb640cs1ct3q36sky91k` (row `565`, processed `14:31:04Z`) and `transaction.completed` event `evt_01kzkeyfprps28ga8j56f1r2tj` (row `569`, processed `14:31:07Z`).
+
+## Exact local relationship result
+
+- Exact HPOS transaction/customer/gateway linkage resolves the new transaction to existing relationship order `13462`; the order was not selected by recency.
+- Order `13462` is `wc-completed`, customer `352`, gateway `arraysubs_paddle`, total `$5.00`, transaction `txn_01kzkeybgsey4fh7r53v2efhag`.
+- Renewal meta: `_is_renewal_order=yes`, `_renewal_cycle_number=2`, `_renewal_scheduled_date=2026-08-09 14:30:08`, `_subscription_id=13344`, `_subscription_renewal=13344`, `_subscription_payment_processed=yes`.
+- Exactly one relationship order exists for subscription `13344` and that scheduled cycle.
+- Order item `730` remains one `SLT Plan Basic` line, quantity `1`, line total `$5.00`.
+- Failed switch/proration order `13354` remains separate and pending for `$9.90`; subscription `_arraysubs_switch_processed` remains absent.
+- Subscription `13344` remains active on product `12608` / recurring amount `$5.00`; completed payments advanced `1→2`; local next payment is `2026-08-10 14:30:08Z`, matching Paddle to second precision.
+- Local charge action `16097` was canceled unattempted at `14:31:10Z`; replacements `16482` (invoice `2026-08-10 08:55:18Z`) and `16483` (charge `2026-08-10 14:55:18Z`) are pending.
+
+## Mailpit delta
+
+The complete delta after `MAIL_PRE` contains exactly two messages:
+
+1. `7VcgBrWvc2S4c0q9LiEodq` — `[mirror-help.arrayhash.com]: You've got a new order: #13462` — to `admin@mirror-help.arrayhash.com`.
+2. `5DrgO7Y660rDiXmD8dMojT` — `[mirror-help.arrayhash.com] Payment received for subscription #13344` — to `slt-paddle@example.test`; body states Basic, `$5.00`, Paddle, and next payment 10 August 2026 8:30 PM (UTC+6).
+
+No invoice, failure, retry, on-hold, plan-switch, or customer WooCommerce processing/completed message appears in the delta.
+
+## Persistence findings to recheck at stable cutoff
+
+- Order `13462` has a valid HPOS transaction but no `_paddle_transaction_id` or `_last_gateway_transaction_id` order-meta row. This recurs under the existing Paddle renewal-order finding.
+- Its pre-created product line is present, narrowing the earlier zero-item symptom to retroactive Paddle renewal-order creation.
+- Item `730` has neither `_subscription_id` nor `_arraysubs_subscription_id`, extending the already-filed renewal-item linkage finding to a Paddle order.
+- Immediately after settlement, subscription `_last_gateway_transaction_id` still held the initial transaction rather than the new renewal transaction; this requires a stable-cutoff/counterexample check before classification.
+
+## Stable cutoff, browser proof, and findings
+
+- Repeated polls through `2026-08-09 14:42:02Z` / `20:42:02` site remained identical: two total remote transactions, exactly one recurring transaction, order `13462` completed with the exact transaction, one relationship order for the cycle, action `16097` canceled/unattempted, and Mailpit latest still the single customer success message. No duplicate charge, order, webhook effect, or mail appeared.
+- `/home/server-manager/slt-evidence/SLT-SW-05-D07-order-13462.png` visibly proves Completed, Payment via Paddle with transaction `txn_01kzkeybgsey4fh7r53v2efhag`, linked subscription `13344`, one Basic line at quantity `1`, and `$5.00` paid. Browser errors were empty and no actionable console error appeared.
+- The exact browser session `admin-SLT-SW-05-D07-watch` was closed. The CLI retained a stale session-list marker, but no matching browser process remained; unrelated `default` was preserved.
