+- New finding filed: `issues/SLT-SW-05-paddle-renewal-leaves-subscription-last-transaction-stale.md`. At stable comparison, both Paddle subscriptions `13344` and `12639` retained their initial checkout transaction in subscription `_last_gateway_transaction_id`, while same-watch Stripe controls `12684` and `12221` stored their newest renewal transaction.
+- Existing findings updated rather than duplicated:
