+- `LOCAL_GATE_PRE=5DrgO7Y660rDiXmD8dMojT` was captured at `2026-08-09 14:50:42Z` / `20:50:44` site, inside the authored `20:50:18–20:55:17` interval.
+- At that boundary, action `16097` was canceled/unattempted with only its creation and webhook-time cancellation logs; order `13462` was completed with the exact Paddle transaction; order `13354` remained pending; payments were `2`; next payment was D8; and exactly one relationship order existed for the cycle.
+- Repeated polls straddled the scheduled `20:55:18` local time and remained identical through `2026-08-09 15:05:46Z` / `21:05:46` site, more than ten minutes after the gate.
+- The complete Mailpit delta after `LOCAL_GATE_PRE` was empty. No second charge, action attempt, order, cycle/date advance, retry/failure, note, or mail occurred.
