+- Severity: medium
+- Date found: 2026-08-09
+- Watch day: D07
+- Originating test task: `SLT-SW-05` / card `#96`
+- Plan file: `kanban/tasks/096-upgrade-a-paddle-billed-ladder-subscription-and.md`
+
+## Affected records
